IFPREVERB BREAK 12
  CLEARVERB
  CALL 9305
ENDIF
IFPREVERB KICK 12
  CLEARVERB
  CALL 9305
ENDIF
IFPREVERB PUNCH 12
  CLEARVERB
  CALL 9305
