; Speaking Marren's name by the chest (stage 6). "Marren" anywhere in a SAY.
IFSAY MARREN
  IFVAR HWLANTERN = 6
    EQUAL HWLANTERN 7
    GMMSG [Last Lantern] %N spoke Marren's name. Stage 7: SEARCH GRAVESTONES + PUT <symbol> TOKEN ON <symbol> GRAVESTONE.
    ECHO ALL The air beside the chest shivers and grows cold, and Marren Vey is there, his hooded lantern dark in his hand.
    PLREVENT 4
    CONTPLREVENT
    ECHO ALL Marren Vey says, "For a thousand years, thieves have searched for what you found this night. Yet you followed my words instead of disturbing my dead."
    PLREVENT 6
    CONTPLREVENT
    ECHO ALL Marren Vey says, "Return the funeral tokens to the graves from which they came. Take what was mine. Let Fayd remember that Marren Vey kept faith -- even after death."
    PLREVENT 5
    CONTPLREVENT
    ECHO ALL [Each token belongs to one grave. SEARCH GRAVESTONES to find the grave that matches the token you carry, then PUT the token ON its gravestone -- for example, PUT SUNRISE TOKEN ON SUNRISE GRAVESTONE.]
  ENDIF
ENDIF
; --- story: the gravestones ---
IFPREVERB SEARCH 14
  CLEARVERB
  IFVAR HWLANTERN < 7
    ECHO PLAYER You wander among the broken gravestones. The runes on them are unreadable, and one grave looks much like another.
  ELSE
    EQUAL DUMMY1 0
    IFCARRY 9320
      EQUAL DUMMY1 1
      IFNOITEM 20
        NEWITEM 20 9332
      ENDIF
      ECHO PLAYER Your sunrise token grows warm. Following it, you find the gravestone of Adren Bell, carved with a rising sun divided by a vertical line.
    ENDIF
    IFCARRY 9321
      EQUAL DUMMY1 1
      IFNOITEM 21
        NEWITEM 21 9333
      ENDIF
      ECHO PLAYER Your teardrop token grows warm. Following it, you find the gravestone of Myra Sol, carved with a closed eye shedding a single tear.
    ENDIF
    IFCARRY 9322
      EQUAL DUMMY1 1
      IFNOITEM 22
        NEWITEM 22 9334
      ENDIF
      ECHO PLAYER Your wheatsheaf token grows warm. Following it, you find the gravestone of Pellan Roe, carved with three stalks of wheat bound with cord.
    ENDIF
    IFCARRY 9323
      EQUAL DUMMY1 1
      IFNOITEM 23
        NEWITEM 23 9335
      ENDIF
      ECHO PLAYER Your hammer token grows warm. Following it, you find the gravestone of Torven Dane, carved with a hammer resting across a small flame.
    ENDIF
    IFCARRY 9324
      EQUAL DUMMY1 1
      IFNOITEM 24
        NEWITEM 24 9336
      ENDIF
      ECHO PLAYER Your birdcage token grows warm. Following it, you find the gravestone of Sera Noll, carved with a bird escaping an open cage.
    ENDIF
    IFCARRY 9325
      EQUAL DUMMY1 1
      IFNOITEM 25
        NEWITEM 25 9337
      ENDIF
      ECHO PLAYER Your crescent token grows warm. Following it, you find the gravestone of Edris and Mara Vann, carved with two hands clasped beneath a crescent moon.
    ENDIF
    IFCARRY 9326
      EQUAL DUMMY1 1
      IFNOITEM 26
        NEWITEM 26 9338
      ENDIF
      ECHO PLAYER Your star token grows warm. Following it, you find the gravestone of Oren Vale, carved with a five-pointed star above three wavy lines.
    ENDIF
    IFCARRY 9327
      EQUAL DUMMY1 1
      IFNOITEM 27
        NEWITEM 27 9339
      ENDIF
      ECHO PLAYER Your hound token grows warm. Following it, you find the gravestone of Hessa Korr, carved with a hound seated beneath a full moon.
    ENDIF
    IFCARRY 9328
      EQUAL DUMMY1 1
      IFNOITEM 28
        NEWITEM 28 9340
      ENDIF
      ECHO PLAYER Your quill token grows warm. Following it, you find the gravestone of Talven Mor, carved with a quill laid across an ornate key.
    ENDIF
    IFCARRY 9329
      EQUAL DUMMY1 1
      IFNOITEM 29
        NEWITEM 29 9341
      ENDIF
      ECHO PLAYER Your leafless token grows warm. Following it, you find the gravestone of Ilyra Fen, carved with a leafless tree with seven exposed roots.
    ENDIF
    IFCARRY 9330
      EQUAL DUMMY1 1
      IFNOITEM 30
        NEWITEM 30 9342
      ENDIF
      ECHO PLAYER Your handprint token grows warm. Following it, you find the gravestone of Jory Pell, carved with the small handprint of a child.
    ENDIF
    IFCARRY 9331
      EQUAL DUMMY1 1
      IFNOITEM 31
        NEWITEM 31 9343
      ENDIF
      ECHO PLAYER Your lantern token grows warm. Following it, you find the gravestone of Elira Vey, carved with an unlit hooded lantern.
    ENDIF
    IFVAR DUMMY1 = 0
      ECHO PLAYER Hundreds of graves crowd the hillock. Without a funeral token to guide you, one broken stone looks much like another.
    ELSE
      ECHO OTHERS %N moves slowly among the gravestones, following a token held in an outstretched hand.
    ENDIF
  ENDIF
ENDIF
